                <div class="srow"><span>Hydrostatic test pressure</span><span class="v signal">225 PSI</span></div>
                <div class="srow"><span>Vacuum jacket insulation</span><span class="v signal">&lt;10 mTorr · −60% heat loss</span></div>
                <div class="srow"><span>Heater element</span><span class="v brass">Incoloy 800 · 2,000W</span></div>
